@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+---
+"haulers-dream": patch
+---
+
+Ordering another pawn to haul an item reserved by a nearby sweep now hands off that item while preserving the first pawn's remaining pickups and queued orders. Forced sweeps no longer take incidental extras away from other haulers.
